WEBVTT

00:10.230 --> 00:12.130
It's them!

00:18.080 --> 00:19.970
We actually managed to meet up!

00:19.970 --> 00:21.830
We're not letting you get away again, Asuna. {orig:I'm not gonna letting go, Asuna}

00:21.830 --> 00:23.830
You guys actually came?!

00:23.830 --> 00:26.870
Let's all tour London together!

00:26.870 --> 00:29.130
What are you guys going to do after that?

00:29.130 --> 00:32.630
We're all going to head over to Negi-kun's hometown.

00:32.630 --> 00:34.050
Ah! No! Konoka!

00:35.340 --> 00:36.640
Negi-sensei's...

00:37.030 --> 00:40.060
Negi-sensei's hometown, you say?

00:41.960 --> 00:46.780
Um... I would like to accompany you. W-Would that be possible?

00:46.780 --> 00:47.900
Y-Yes...

00:49.670 --> 00:50.960
Hey, is it really all right?

00:50.960 --> 00:54.470
Isn't your hometown full of mages?

00:54.470 --> 00:55.900
Uh... That's...

00:55.900 --> 00:57.600
It's fine, Negi-kun.

00:58.240 --> 01:01.130
There's no problem with bringing everyone along.

01:01.130 --> 01:04.000
We have permission from the Headmaster of Meldiana Academy too.

01:04.000 --> 01:05.800
Ah! You're...

01:05.800 --> 01:07.000
McGuinness-san!

01:07.000 --> 01:09.550
Eh? You know each other?

01:07.000 --> 01:09.550
Eh? You know each other?

01:20.180 --> 01:22.850
So this is Negi-kun's hometown?

01:31.400 --> 01:33.450
So? How is it, Negi?

01:33.450 --> 01:35.780
How does it feel to be back in your hometown after so long?

01:37.640 --> 01:41.800
Well... I only left this place a short while ago,

01:41.800 --> 01:45.950
but it feels like I haven't been here for ages.

01:46.490 --> 01:47.410
Well,

01:47.410 --> 01:49.390
a lot has happened.

01:49.390 --> 01:50.830
Quite a lot in fact.

01:51.640 --> 01:52.920
Negi!

01:57.530 --> 01:59.220
Negi!

02:00.430 --> 02:01.600
Onee-chan!

02:03.300 --> 02:04.930
Negi!

02:04.930 --> 02:06.230
Onee-chan!

02:10.190 --> 02:11.570
My my.

02:13.990 --> 02:16.310
Shouldn't it be... the other way around?

02:13.990 --> 02:16.310
Negi!

02:16.310 --> 02:16.940
Negi!

02:19.660 --> 02:21.550
How have you been, Onee-chan?

02:21.550 --> 02:22.830
You haven't been sick, have you?

02:22.830 --> 02:26.080
Rather, have you been eating properly, Negi?

02:26.080 --> 02:27.290
You haven't caught a cold, right?

02:28.830 --> 02:31.600
Oh yeah! Let me introduce you, Onee-chan.

02:31.600 --> 02:34.040
These are my friends... all my students.

02:34.040 --> 02:36.930
My, there are so many of you!

02:36.930 --> 02:39.260
This isn't even all of them!

02:39.260 --> 02:40.120
Hello.

02:40.120 --> 02:41.170
Nice to meet ya!

02:40.150 --> 02:41.880
Nice to meet you, Onee-chan!

02:41.170 --> 02:42.390
You're really pretty!

02:42.390 --> 02:44.880
Yeah, as pretty as I'd expected.

02:43.140 --> 02:44.880
There sure are a lot of us here...

02:51.150 --> 02:53.390
Please excuse us.

02:53.390 --> 02:55.410
For so many of us to intrude on your hospitality

02:55.410 --> 02:56.860
and yet still be treated to such a feast...

02:56.860 --> 03:00.150
This food is really delicious!

03:00.500 --> 03:03.890
How wonderful. Having such a pretty sister!

03:03.890 --> 03:08.790
Yeah, and by looking at his sister I can tell why Negi-kun is so polite too.

03:08.790 --> 03:11.800
Oh no... But I am relieved,

03:11.800 --> 03:14.840
to see him supported by such energetic and cute people.

03:15.560 --> 03:19.420
Please continue to take good care of Negi.

03:19.420 --> 03:20.230
Yes!

03:20.230 --> 03:22.000
No problem!

03:21.280 --> 03:22.920
Leave it to us!

03:25.290 --> 03:27.180
Um... Onee-chan?

03:28.410 --> 03:29.180
What is it?

03:29.600 --> 03:31.960
There's something I need to talk to you about later.

03:32.360 --> 03:33.110
Is that okay?

05:18.960 --> 05:20.200
What?!

05:20.200 --> 05:22.710
You're going to the Magic Country?!

05:23.080 --> 05:24.800
I'm sorry, Onee-chan.

05:25.180 --> 05:27.300
But... it's to search for Father's whereabouts.

05:31.320 --> 05:33.660
But you're still only ten years old.

05:33.660 --> 05:37.390
The gate to Mundus Magicus won't open so easily...

05:38.560 --> 05:41.190
That's why I will be lending him a hand.

05:41.190 --> 05:42.440
Headmaster!

05:42.440 --> 05:43.330
Yo!

05:44.110 --> 05:45.360
Ojii-chan!

05:45.360 --> 05:48.240
It's been a while. I'm back!

05:48.240 --> 05:52.200
"Observe carefully a man you have not met for three days," or so they say.

05:52.200 --> 05:54.700
I almost didn't recognize you, Negi.

05:55.660 --> 05:57.070
Um...

05:57.070 --> 05:58.040
Ojii-chan...

05:58.240 --> 05:59.570
I know.

06:00.420 --> 06:04.130
This day has come much earlier than I had expected.

06:04.540 --> 06:07.510
Are you prepared to see it with your own eyes?

06:08.260 --> 06:09.430
Yes!

06:11.650 --> 06:12.990
Follow me.

06:18.960 --> 06:25.010
After the incident, all the people of your village were moved here.

06:26.860 --> 06:28.570
Stan... -san...

06:28.570 --> 06:31.360
It's me, Negi.

06:32.790 --> 06:34.660
Even though it's been six years,

06:35.290 --> 06:38.160
you're still the same as you were then.

06:38.160 --> 06:42.330
If you and Onee-chan hadn't saved me back then,

06:42.330 --> 06:47.590
I know I would be here with everyone else, turned into stone.

06:47.970 --> 06:52.230
And then I wouldn't have been able to meet Asuna-san and the rest of 3-A.

06:52.230 --> 06:53.120
Stan-san...

06:54.600 --> 06:55.720
Oji-san!

06:59.350 --> 07:01.700
Oji-san, Stan-san.

07:01.700 --> 07:05.820
Please have a look. I've grown so much.

07:06.520 --> 07:10.360
It's thanks to you that I'm here today.

07:17.200 --> 07:19.120
Well then, we're going, Onee-chan.

07:19.120 --> 07:21.620
Okay. Be careful, Negi.

07:21.620 --> 07:23.880
Anya and everyone else too.

07:33.220 --> 07:36.650
Sorry about this, Maki-chan, Iinchou. We're heading off.

07:36.650 --> 07:38.600
What do you mean by "Sorry about this"?

07:41.640 --> 07:42.940
Iinchou!

07:43.290 --> 07:45.090
What are you doing here?!

07:45.090 --> 07:49.290
What I mean is... why... uh...

07:49.290 --> 07:50.040
Ah...

07:50.040 --> 07:51.900
Don't tell me you plan on following us?

07:56.080 --> 07:57.410
Of course!

07:57.410 --> 08:02.500
I will follow Negi-sensei, even through fire, water or to the ends of the Earth!

08:03.620 --> 08:06.410
Do you really think I'd say that, you big idiot?!

08:06.410 --> 08:07.000
Oh...

08:07.000 --> 08:09.240
I keep my promises.

08:11.260 --> 08:13.260
I can't accompany you.

08:14.190 --> 08:19.280
But Asuna-san, don't think I'll let it slide if Negi-sensei gets hurt!

08:20.020 --> 08:25.270
Leave it to me! Even if I get all beaten up, I'll bring him back unharmed!

08:25.270 --> 08:27.650
And what are you going to do if <i>you</i> get hurt?!

08:27.650 --> 08:29.860
Then what are you telling me to do?!

08:30.480 --> 08:33.360
For all of you to return unharmed, of course.

08:33.360 --> 08:35.490
It'll be fine.

08:35.490 --> 08:38.740
It seems that the trip will be a lot safer than we had planned.

08:38.740 --> 08:40.670
Then it's fine.

08:40.670 --> 08:42.750
I just have a bad premonition...

08:43.840 --> 08:46.880
Your premonitions have never been right!

08:46.880 --> 08:49.630
Asuna-san! What are you doing?

08:49.630 --> 08:51.630
Come on. Off with you.

08:51.990 --> 08:53.880
Thanks, Iinchou.

08:54.270 --> 08:56.540
I'll tell you everything someday.

08:57.640 --> 08:59.400
I'll be waiting without expectations.

09:01.360 --> 09:02.720
What's wrong?

09:02.720 --> 09:03.890
Nothing.

09:07.460 --> 09:11.150
Have a safe trip, Negi-sensei, Asuna-san.

09:12.400 --> 09:15.530
Everyone, you have the robes from the inn, right?

09:15.530 --> 09:16.400
Yep!

09:16.400 --> 09:19.530
Okay then, follow me and don't get separated.

09:19.530 --> 09:21.370
No problem, Donette-san!

09:24.220 --> 09:26.090
We're not letting you get away, Negi-kun!

09:26.090 --> 09:29.460
It's a good thing we brought these coats from the inn.

09:29.460 --> 09:31.540
Alright! Let's follow them!

09:48.930 --> 09:52.440
<i>Gate... the door to the other world.</i>

09:53.200 --> 09:58.450
<i>On the other side, the world that Father lived and fought in awaits.</i>

09:58.450 --> 10:00.370
<i>Alright! Here we go!</i>

10:00.370 --> 10:01.930
<i>To the Magic World!</i>

10:01.930 --> 10:03.510
<i>To Father's World!</i>

10:07.330 --> 10:08.370
It's time.

10:08.370 --> 10:09.580
I've been waiting!

10:09.580 --> 10:10.960
At last.

10:10.960 --> 10:13.710
Man, they really made us wait-aru. {orig: +ne}

10:17.720 --> 10:19.330
The ground's glowing!

10:19.330 --> 10:21.040
What's this? Will we be okay?

10:21.040 --> 10:22.050
I dunno!{orig: I don't know!}

10:32.360 --> 10:34.650
This is bad. This is really bad!

10:34.650 --> 10:36.680
Everyone, retreat!

11:15.520 --> 11:17.320
Are we here already?

11:17.320 --> 11:19.150
Yes, we've arrived.

11:21.650 --> 11:26.700
If you head over there, you can take a look at the city before we go through immigrations.

11:28.420 --> 11:29.580
I'll be going ahead!

11:30.830 --> 11:33.960
Hey! Wait up, you guys! I want to see too!

11:34.920 --> 11:39.030
Now then, Negi-sensei, we should reclaim our staffs and other luggage first.

11:39.030 --> 11:39.840
Yes!

11:43.490 --> 11:45.230
What was that? Where is this?

11:45.230 --> 11:46.720
I don't know!

11:46.720 --> 11:49.470
I'm gonna ask the people nearby.

11:49.980 --> 11:51.210
You idiot!

11:58.910 --> 12:00.500
Amazing!

12:10.700 --> 12:15.540
Your staff, blades and other weapons are all inside this Seal Box.

12:15.920 --> 12:21.560
It's sealed with powerful magic, so please understand that it cannot be opened till you leave the Gateport.

12:22.240 --> 12:23.550
Negi-sensei!

12:23.550 --> 12:24.700
We have a problem!

12:24.700 --> 12:27.430
There are stowaways at the Gate: your students!

12:33.890 --> 12:37.760
Negi-kun! What's going on here?!

12:38.520 --> 12:40.070
Ma-Makie-san!

12:40.070 --> 12:41.820
How did you get here?!

12:42.620 --> 12:44.750
I know we promised. We're so sorry.

12:44.750 --> 12:46.600
But we wanted to follow you no matter what...

12:46.600 --> 12:50.030
More importantly, what happened? I don't get it...

12:50.030 --> 12:53.030
Where is this? What's going on?

12:53.030 --> 12:54.720
Geez... I don't know what's what anymore!

12:56.710 --> 12:58.840
<i>How did this happen!?</i>

12:58.840 --> 13:00.170
<i>W-What should I do?</i>

13:00.170 --> 13:02.280
<i>Makie-san and the others will find out about magic!</i>

13:02.280 --> 13:03.530
<i>That's not it!</i>

13:03.530 --> 13:06.150
<i>It's all my fault!</i>

13:09.950 --> 13:11.650
Are you serious?!

13:11.650 --> 13:13.280
How did they get here?!

13:14.390 --> 13:17.190
Looks like it just became troublesome-aru.

13:17.190 --> 13:19.940
<i>W-W-What should I do?</i>

13:27.020 --> 13:28.320
<i>This sensation...</i>

13:31.090 --> 13:32.870
Negi-sensei, what's wrong?

13:32.870 --> 13:34.290
<i>I knew it.</i>

13:34.290 --> 13:35.410
<i>There's no way I could forget it.</i>

13:35.790 --> 13:39.750
<i>I don't know how it happened, but if Makie-san and the others were able to get in,</i>

13:39.750 --> 13:42.370
<i>it wouldn't be unusual that other people did too.</i>

13:42.370 --> 13:49.180
<i>No matter how strict the security is, there are still cases of accidents and incidents occuring, even in the real world.</i>

13:50.320 --> 13:51.110
Aniki?

13:51.110 --> 13:54.520
Setsuna-san. Your detection techniques again, please.

13:54.520 --> 13:58.050
Guardsmen, how many guards are here?

13:58.050 --> 14:00.150
W-What are you talking about?

14:00.150 --> 14:01.890
Please call everyone you've got.

14:01.890 --> 14:03.050
It's an emergency situation!

14:03.050 --> 14:04.930
But you-

14:04.930 --> 14:05.670
Hurry!

14:06.150 --> 14:08.000
Master Ku, Asuna-san.

14:08.000 --> 14:10.250
Come here and protect Makie-san and the others.

14:10.250 --> 14:12.090
H-hey, what?

14:12.090 --> 14:15.550
Kaede-san, McGuinness-san is at the Immigrations Office.

14:15.550 --> 14:18.540
Kotarou-kun, get Nodoka and the others from the Terrace.

14:19.680 --> 14:22.260
Anya, you have your portable staff, right?

14:22.260 --> 14:25.540
Help me make a Magic Barrier at full power.

14:25.540 --> 14:27.350
Negi, what are you talking about?!

14:27.970 --> 14:30.740
Hey, you can't use magic here.

14:30.740 --> 14:31.950
Negi-sensei.

14:31.950 --> 14:32.930
Aniki.

14:33.330 --> 14:36.560
If I'm getting carried away, we can laugh about it later. {orig: If I'm wrong about this, we'll laugh about it later.}

14:37.330 --> 14:38.980
He noticed me?

14:40.300 --> 14:42.160
That should've been impossible, but...

14:42.160 --> 14:44.320
is that also what his blood can do? {orig: Is that because of his blood?}

14:44.320 --> 14:47.170
Whatever. I guess I'll greet them.

14:51.700 --> 14:52.910
Negi!!

15:05.950 --> 15:08.070
<i>This is... a stone spear...</i>

15:08.310 --> 15:09.710
<i>This wound's fatal...</i>

15:09.710 --> 15:11.330
<i>This is bad... really bad.</i>

15:12.140 --> 15:12.940
<i>This can't be...</i>

15:13.150 --> 15:14.230
<i>That's right.</i>

15:14.230 --> 15:15.620
<i>There's no mistake about it.</i>

15:15.620 --> 15:17.080
<i>It's just like the school trip!</i>

15:18.500 --> 15:18.980
<i>Anya...</i>

15:20.280 --> 15:21.390
<i>Asuna-san...</i>

15:21.970 --> 15:22.980
<i>No!</i>

15:22.980 --> 15:23.520
<i>Ru-</i>

15:25.320 --> 15:26.610
Negi!!

15:31.940 --> 15:32.880
Negi-sensei!

15:33.810 --> 15:36.190
Ku! Bring Konoka Ojou-sama here!

15:40.590 --> 15:43.110
Negi! Negi! Why...?!

15:43.110 --> 15:43.660
What should I do?!

15:44.030 --> 15:44.880
Setsuna-san!

15:46.620 --> 15:47.300
Ku!

15:47.960 --> 15:48.840
Negi-ku-

15:50.680 --> 15:52.230
Eh... What's this?

15:52.940 --> 15:54.000
Ojou-sama!

15:53.730 --> 15:54.950
Hold on, Negi!

15:54.000 --> 15:54.860
Aniki!

15:57.110 --> 15:58.350
Negi!!

15:58.890 --> 16:00.350
Negi!!

16:00.900 --> 16:03.160
What's this? Are they filming a movie?

16:03.690 --> 16:05.360
Asuna's acting is so realistic...

16:05.360 --> 16:06.770
No... are they in shock?

16:06.770 --> 16:07.870
Negi-kun!

16:08.100 --> 16:09.120
Blood...

16:10.230 --> 16:11.490
Ojou-sama! Pull yourself together!

16:11.910 --> 16:14.260
Negi-sensei has a life-threatening wound.

16:14.470 --> 16:15.770
Ojou-sama, your artifact!

16:17.120 --> 16:22.120
Yeah, b-but Secchan, my pactio card is still sealed!

16:23.470 --> 16:24.530
What should we do?

16:24.760 --> 16:28.710
My power can't heal him after three minutes have elapsed!

16:29.310 --> 16:31.670
Isn't there a way to open that box somehow?

16:31.670 --> 16:32.480
It's impossible.

16:32.680 --> 16:34.020
It doesn't matter what we try.

16:34.020 --> 16:37.730
It's sealed with a type of magic that makes it theoretically impossible to open.

16:37.990 --> 16:38.860
Please calm down.

16:39.240 --> 16:41.080
Reinforcements will be here soon.

16:41.080 --> 16:42.980
The greatest healers will also come.

16:43.410 --> 16:44.770
We'll save that boy.

16:45.750 --> 16:47.730
Then make them hurry up!

16:48.440 --> 16:50.470
You can't... Asuna-san...

16:50.730 --> 16:52.880
Negi? No, you mustn't speak.

16:52.880 --> 16:55.410
Run... away...

16:55.410 --> 16:55.940
Eh?!

17:07.640 --> 17:08.540
Guardsmen!

17:09.700 --> 17:14.180
It's been a while, Negi Springfield and his comrades.

17:15.030 --> 17:17.450
While you seem to have powered up somewhat,

17:17.990 --> 17:20.140
with only one of my attacks, you're already in this state.

17:20.870 --> 17:24.520
Half-assed power is so unsightly...

17:29.000 --> 17:31.880
Don't you think so, Negi-kun?

17:31.880 --> 17:34.030
Fate... Averruncus!

17:34.650 --> 17:35.500
You bastard!

17:35.830 --> 17:36.490
Run...

18:53.900 --> 18:56.980
Black and Spherical Prison.

18:53.900 --> 18:56.980
Μελάν Και Σφαιρικόν Δεσμωτήριον

18:58.470 --> 19:00.200
Cherry Blossom Viewing Moon {orig: Cherry blossoms in the evening viewing the moon.}

18:58.470 --> 19:00.200
Tsukimi no Yozakura

19:12.340 --> 19:13.330
Kotarou-kun!

19:13.610 --> 19:14.880
Kaede! Kotarou!

19:14.880 --> 19:15.590
Setsuna-san!

19:19.660 --> 19:21.090
What are you people?

19:22.540 --> 19:23.810
What do you want?!

19:23.810 --> 19:25.470
Have you been following us?!

19:25.940 --> 19:27.710
Following? Don't be absurd.

19:28.200 --> 19:31.550
Encountering you guys here was a complete coincidence.

19:32.260 --> 19:35.260
Our objective is here... this place.

19:36.000 --> 19:38.010
You guys were unrelated this time.

19:38.150 --> 19:40.840
Y-Y-You call this unrelated?!

19:40.840 --> 19:43.020
Who do you think you are?!

19:42.440 --> 19:43.030
Anya!

19:43.470 --> 19:44.950
It was an unfortunate circumstance.

19:45.320 --> 19:48.790
I would never have expected Negi-kun to detect our presence.

19:49.470 --> 19:52.520
But because he noticed us, I had no choice.

19:53.420 --> 19:56.000
I couldn't let him call for reinforcements, after all.

19:56.610 --> 20:00.250
Just so you know, no one's coming to save you.

20:00.810 --> 20:03.890
This place is completely isolated from the outside.

20:05.400 --> 20:06.580
<i>This is bad.</i>

20:06.580 --> 20:08.010
<i>There's nothing I can do.</i>

20:08.010 --> 20:09.670
<i>And Negi-sensei's wound...</i>

20:10.800 --> 20:11.790
<i>What should I do?</i>

20:12.460 --> 20:13.780
<i>What should I do?!</i>

20:14.790 --> 20:17.080
<i>It's already been more than two minutes.</i>

20:17.840 --> 20:20.730
<i>Without weapons, there's nothing I can do!</i>

20:21.740 --> 20:22.710
<i>What should I do?</i>

20:23.390 --> 20:24.450
<i>What should I do?</i>

20:25.070 --> 20:25.830
<i>I...</i>

20:28.500 --> 20:29.290
Negi-kun.

20:29.700 --> 20:35.820
Your comrades... To me, they are nothing but trash.

20:35.820 --> 20:38.730
I can't find any reason to erase their existence now...

20:38.730 --> 20:40.920
Then again, I don't see any reason not to.

20:42.100 --> 20:42.970
This is perfect.

20:43.550 --> 20:47.930
How about I use my Eternal Petrification and have them all exit the stage?

20:49.370 --> 20:49.970
<i>Ojou-sama!</i>

20:50.710 --> 20:53.730
Well then, I'll start with you, Sakurazaki Setsuna.

21:01.970 --> 21:02.680
Negi-kun!

21:03.050 --> 21:05.780
That, I will not allow!

21:06.610 --> 21:07.870
I'm your opponent!

21:08.520 --> 21:10.570
Dear me... You'll die.

21:11.250 --> 21:13.350
It's a nuisance to me if you die now.

21:15.490 --> 21:17.850
Besides, how do you plan on fighting without weapons?

21:21.190 --> 21:23.250
What the...? It opened!

21:24.240 --> 21:24.920
Negi...

21:26.980 --> 21:27.810
Negi!

21:31.140 --> 21:31.990
Konoka!

21:37.980 --> 21:39.910
Adeat!

21:37.980 --> 21:39.910
Adeat!

21:59.870 --> 22:00.540
What was that?

22:00.540 --> 22:02.130
What was that sound?

22:02.130 --> 22:03.240
What's happening?

22:03.840 --> 22:05.180
More trouble?

22:05.180 --> 22:07.030
What happened there? An accident?

22:10.080 --> 22:11.660
That white-haired boy is...

22:12.710 --> 22:13.970
Red... blood?

22:14.430 --> 22:15.730
Negi-sensei is hurt?!

22:17.270 --> 22:21.630
Heal Negi's injury! There's probably less than 30 seconds left!

22:21.630 --> 22:27.990
Uh, yeah. But, Asuna, I have to get close enough to touch him to heal such a serious wound!

22:28.840 --> 22:30.570
I understand. Leave it to me!

22:30.920 --> 22:32.090
Ku Fei! Cover me!

22:32.090 --> 22:33.180
Roger -aru!

22:37.930 --> 22:39.990
Excuse me, Princess.

22:40.420 --> 22:41.500
Stone Breath

22:40.420 --> 22:41.500
Πνοή Πέτρας

22:46.650 --> 22:47.460
Konoka!

22:57.230 --> 22:59.980
I won't let you lay a finger on Ojou-sama!

23:00.500 --> 23:01.400
Secchan!

23:01.700 --> 23:04.220
Shi Ka Shi Shi Ku Shi Ro! {Setsuna's Artifact name -Southrop}

23:41.540 --> 23:42.340
Did I get him?

23:45.140 --> 23:47.380
There's no way it could be that easy, right -aru?

23:49.980 --> 23:50.490
Konoka!

23:50.490 --> 23:50.860
Okay.

23:51.150 --> 23:52.150
Neechan! Above!

23:58.380 --> 23:59.070
Asuna!

23:59.070 --> 24:00.120
It's fine! Heal Negi!

24:01.990 --> 24:03.270
I'll get you!

24:05.320 --> 24:10.660
You also seem to have grown up to be quite delectable, Princess.

24:10.660 --> 24:11.700
Crap! {orig: Shit!}

24:16.310 --> 24:17.600
Inugami Kotarou?

24:20.540 --> 24:21.770
A charm on the hair?

24:26.500 --> 24:28.690
Kotarou? I thought they got you!

24:28.940 --> 24:30.920
Yeah, it was bad!

24:30.920 --> 24:31.980
Anyway, how's Negi?

24:31.980 --> 24:33.320
Hey, Kotarou!

24:34.020 --> 24:36.320
What happened to the thanks for the recovery spell?!

24:37.820 --> 24:40.160
They totally got me -de gozaru.

24:40.620 --> 24:42.190
I was practically dead.

24:42.760 --> 24:48.970
"Before the grand castle of the great Ibuki, I bow in prayer to the heavens."

24:49.460 --> 24:53.340
"I invoke the sacred skills of the gods which are at their sole command."

24:53.640 --> 25:04.000
"Bestow upon my friends, these pale warriors gathered before the gods of heaven, a blessing of protection and a gift of good fortune."

25:04.300 --> 25:15.990
"I, Konoe Konoka of the Fujiwara clan, give up my living soul, within this mitegura, as an offering for the gods to drink."

25:16.950 --> 25:17.920
Konoka-san...

25:22.320 --> 25:23.310
It's all right.

25:29.940 --> 25:32.090
You'll be all right, Negi-kun.

25:32.840 --> 25:34.970
Thank goodness. I made it!

25:35.320 --> 25:36.010
Negi!

25:36.010 --> 25:37.340
Great! Time for the counterattack!

25:37.810 --> 25:38.380
Kaede!

25:38.380 --> 25:40.550
I let my guard down -de gozaru.

25:40.550 --> 25:42.470
I didn't think they'd get you.

25:43.560 --> 25:44.390
<i>Negi!</i>

25:50.600 --> 25:52.820
I see. Not bad.

25:53.500 --> 25:56.220
I take back what I said about your comrades being trash.

25:56.450 --> 25:58.550
Who the hell are you guys?

25:58.850 --> 25:59.820
What are you up to?

26:00.360 --> 26:02.730
Unfortunately, time is up.

26:03.030 --> 26:04.830
We'll leave it at this.

26:05.020 --> 26:06.080
I said wait!

26:06.080 --> 26:09.330
Whatever you're planning, I'll stop you!

26:16.370 --> 26:18.270
How do you plan to do it in that state?

26:25.220 --> 26:26.760
Besides it's already too late.

26:27.450 --> 26:29.370
Visju Tal Li Sjutal Vangeit

26:27.450 --> 26:29.370
висю тал ли сютал вангзит

26:30.560 --> 26:33.960
Oh Palace of the Dead Lying in Hell,

26:30.560 --> 26:33.960
Ω Τάρταρω Κείμενον Βασίλειον Νεκρών.

26:36.550 --> 26:39.170
We have already achieved our objective.

26:41.220 --> 26:44.040
Stone Pillar of Hades

26:41.220 --> 26:44.040
Ο Μονόλιθος Κίων Του Αδού

26:49.300 --> 26:49.910
See you later.

27:01.840 --> 27:04.590
What is this?!

27:11.790 --> 27:16.750
Link destruction complete. Separation gate secured. We can escape.

27:16.770 --> 27:17.320
Okay.

27:17.600 --> 27:19.060
Then shall we go?

27:19.490 --> 27:20.630
"Forced Teleportation".

27:21.000 --> 27:23.560
Scatter them all over the corners of the world.

27:24.040 --> 27:24.940
Wait!

27:26.000 --> 27:27.160
Negi-kun.

27:27.160 --> 27:32.100
Perhaps you've spent too long out of the heat to come to this world.

27:32.540 --> 27:36.340
Your reality from here on is a present from me to you.

27:45.290 --> 27:46.220
What's this?! {orig: This is?}

27:46.560 --> 27:49.360
Aniki! It's Forced Teleportation magic!

27:49.360 --> 27:50.280
This is bad!

27:50.280 --> 27:55.360
The Gate's keystones! They've broken the link between the two worlds!

27:55.820 --> 27:58.860
The magic securing the gateway is probably going to go out of control!

28:00.040 --> 28:01.360
Everyone, gather around!

28:01.900 --> 28:03.160
Hold hands!

28:13.100 --> 28:14.630
Negi!!

28:14.950 --> 28:16.630
Asuna-san!!
